<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3705/10  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5705/15  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7630/35  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3610/20  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.36/37   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.3077/97  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1540.4/1.4 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.70/80  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.9600/00  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4859/74  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.0035/45  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4036/46  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7903/08  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7348/58  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6910/20</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$361.20/361.70</p>
